OL,3,GNEWSAHow a public loo played a pivotal
OL,4,Arole in a Cold War spy ring
OL,5,
OL,6,FNestled in the heart of Hampshire,
OL,7,FAlresford is a picturesque Georgian
OL,8,Ftown known for its colourful high
OL,9,Fstreet, historic steam railway and
OL,10,Friverside walks.
OL,12,FBut for a small commemorative plaque on
OL,13,Fthe wall of a public lavatory block,
OL,14,Ffew passing through today would know
OL,15,Fthe part the building played in a Cold
OL,16,FWar Soviet spy ring.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
