OL,3,GNEWSAHow a public loo played a pivotal
OL,4,Arole in a Cold War spy ring
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe inscription reads: "Secret
OL,7,Finformation hidden in this toilet was
OL,8,Fcollected periodically by Harry
OL,9,FHoughton. In 1961 he was sentenced to
OL,10,F15 years imprisonment for his part in
OL,11,Fthe Portland Spy Ring."
OL,13,FRadio Solent's Eleanor Waite has been
OL,14,Fexploring the unusual and surprisingly
OL,15,Fdevious episode in the town's history.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
